<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SOM TO LIST OM'S SWEDISH GOVT BOND FUTURES.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SOM TO LIST OM'S SWEDISH GOVT BOND FUTURES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish derivatives exchange Suomen Optiomeklarit Oy (SOM) said on Friday it would expand its link cooperation with its Swedish counterpart OM Gruppen (OM) by listing Swedish R bond futures from January 2, 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;SOM will list and start clearing Swedish R bond futures trade on Thursday January 2, 1997,&quot; SOM said in a statement.</p>
<p>The futures are based on Swedish government bonds with maturities of two, five and ten years, it said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
